{'symbol': 'GEHC', 'date': '2023-01-09 16:38:00', 'title': 'GE HEALTHCARE ANNOUNCES AGREEMENT TO ACQUIRE IMACTIS TO STRENGTHEN CAPABILITIES IN INTERVENTIONAL GUIDANCE', 'text': 'CHICAGO--( BUSINESS WIRE )--GE HEALTHCARE (NASDAQ: GEHC) TODAY ANNOUNCED IT HAS ENTERED INTO AN AGREEMENT TO ACQUIRE IMACTIS, AN INNOVATOR IN THE RAPIDLY GROWING FIELD OF COMPUTED TOMOGRAPHY (CT) INTERVENTIONAL GUIDANCE ACROSS AN ARRAY OF CARE AREAS. IMACTIS IS A FRANCE-BASED COMPANY THAT WAS FOUNDED IN 2009 BY STEPHANE LAVALLEE AND LIONEL CARRAT, WHO CREATED CT-NAVIGATION™, AN ERGONOMIC UNIVERSAL SOLUTION THAT PROVIDES STEREOTACTIC NEEDLE GUIDANCE, ENABLING INTUITIVE PRE-PLANNING AND CONTINUOUS CONTROL THROUGHOUT A WIDE RANGE OF PROCEDURES, FROM DIAGNOSIS TO TREATMENT.'}